WEBVTT

00:03:29.723 --> 00:03:36.422
(Te qeshura)

00:03:36.422 --> 00:03:41.056
(Duartrokitje)

00:03:41.056 --> 00:03:44.022
Ndoshta duhet te mendohet per nje teori te dyte

00:03:44.022 --> 00:03:46.939
nese e para nuk eshte aq e mire.

00:03:46.939 --> 00:03:48.723
Teoria e dyte eshte qe: A mundemi te permiresohemi?

00:03:48.723 --> 00:03:51.622
(Te qeshura)

00:03:51.622 --> 00:03:54.856
Po per cfare arsye do ta bente dikush nje pyetje te ketille?

00:03:54.856 --> 00:03:57.321
Sepse ne fakt vecse jane bere 29 permiresime deri tani

00:03:57.321 --> 00:03:59.357
te njerezve.

00:03:59.357 --> 00:04:02.207
Si duket ne qenkemi permiresuar.